    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/academic-education-lite/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Academic Education Lite is a versatile and modern multipurpose theme crafted with a clean, minimal, and elegant approach, making it the perfect choice for schools, colleges, universities, training academies, coaching centers, certification institutes, distance learning academies, educational organizations, and online learning platforms seeking a polished and professional online presence. Ideal for e-learning portals, online courses, student portals, academic blogs, and learning management systems, it caters to both small and large institutions with ease. Built on optimized code and powered by the Bootstrap framework, it ensures fast loading, secure performance, and a responsive, mobile-friendly experience across all devices. Its retina-ready design delivers crisp and engaging visuals, while interactive animations and dynamic elements enhance learner engagement. The theme offers extensive customization options including flexible layouts, font variations, and color schemes, allowing institutions to align the site with their brand identity. It features well-designed sections for testimonials, team showcases, banner highlights, and Call to Action (CTA) buttons to drive interaction and conversions. Shortcodes simplify content creation, and social media integration helps boost connectivity and visibility. Fully translation-ready and globally adaptable, it supports multilingual education websites for broader reach. Compatible with the LearnPress plugin, it enables seamless course creation, student management, and online class functionality, making it perfect for e-learning and virtual classrooms. With its blend of modern aesthetics, customization flexibility, and SEO-friendly code, Academic Education Lite delivers a secure, fast, and professional digital environment that reflects credibility and excellence in education."
    },
